osls: 1
id: "22.2"
name: "22.2"
description: "22.2 multichannel layout (9 upper + 10 middle + 3 lower + 2 LFE, 24 ch). ITU-R BS.2051 System H; channel order per ITU-R BS.2217-2. Carries both Cartesian and polar positions (validator-checked equal)."
vendor: io.orbitspatial
tags: [immersive, large-format]
frame: egocentric   # listener-relative (BS.2051 angles, on the unit sphere). Speakers carry both Cartesian x/y/z and polar az/el.
speakers:   # x/y/z = the same points as az/el (az positive = left).
  - { id: M+060, label: M+060, sp: M+060, x: -0.866, y:    0.5, z:    0.0, az:   60, el:   0 }
  - { id: M-060, label: M-060, sp: M-060, x:  0.866, y:    0.5, z:    0.0, az:  -60, el:   0 }
